{"results":[{"url":"https://politifact.com/truth-o-meter/","final_url":"https://politifact.com/truth-o-meter/","title":"National – PolitiFact","description":null,"language":"en","text":"Skip to content\n\n### Stand up for the facts!\n\nOur only agenda is to publish the truth so you can be an informed participant in democracy.   \nWe need your help.\n\nMore Info\n\n# National\n\n## Scorecard\n\n##### true\n\n0%\n750 Checks\n\n##### mostly true\n\n0%\n1052 Checks\n\n##### half true\n\n0%\n1223 Checks\n\n##### mostly false\n\n0%\n1095 Checks\n\n##### false\n\n0%\n1766 Checks\n\n##### Pants on Fire\n\n0%\n765 Checks\n\nFor more details, see the \nPrinciples of PolitiFact\n\n## All Fact-checks for National\n\nDonald Trump   \n\nstated on October 1, 2026 in a Truth Social post:\n\n“I stated, numerous times, that it would take 4-6 weeks to get rid of THE IRAN NUCLEAR THREAT, and I did it in one night!”\n\nBy\nAmy Sherman, \nMaria Briceño\n•\n\nOctober 2, 2026\n\nTikTok posts   \n\nstated on September 28, 2026 in a post:\n\nThese videos show scenes of alleged sexual assault at Cornell University.\n\nBy\nJeff Cercone\n•\n\nOctober 1, 2026\n\nDonald Trump   \n\nstated on September 22, 2026 in a speech to the United Nations General Assembly:\n\nThe people who warned of climate change, the “Russia hoax” and the “Ukraine hoax” are the same people “now saying that AI is going to kill us all.”\n\nBy\nCaleb McCullough, \nLoreben Tuquero\n•\n\nSeptember 22, 2026\n\nSocial Media   \n\nstated on August 23, 2026 in social media posts:\n\nProducts marked as beef on U.S. store shelves “might just be from a foreign country that was buying horses from the U.S. government for the slaughter.”\n\nBy\nMaria Briceño\n•\n\nAugust 25, 2026\n\nDonald Trump   \n\nstated on August 10, 2026 in remarks in the Oval Office:\n\nWhen the measles, mumps and rubella vaccines are given together in the combined MMR vaccine, “there could be a possibility they’re quite lethal.”\n\nBy\nAmy Sherman, \nMadison Czopek\n•\n\nAugust 11, 2026\n\nMike Rogers   \n\nstated on August 5, 2026 in a campaign statement:\n\nAbdul El-Sayed “believes America deserved 9/11.”\n\nBy\nCaleb McCullough\n•\n\nAugust 7, 2026\n\nDonald Trump   \n\nstated on August 3, 2026 in remarks in the Oval Office:\n\n“There was vandalism” at the Reflecting Pool.\n\nBy\nAmy Sherman, \nLouis Jacobson\n•\n\nAugust 4, 2026\n\nJames Fishback   \n\nstated on July 23, 2026 in X post:\n\nThe U.S. Congress just “voted to merge our military with Israel’s military.”\n\nBy\nSamantha Putterman\n•\n\nJuly 29, 2026\n\nX posts   \n\nstated on July 12, 2026 in X posts:\n\nA photo showing Mitch McConnell and his wife is from his 2023 hospitalization or is AI generated.\n\nBy\nCaleb McCullough\n•\n\nJuly 13, 2026\n\nDonald Trump   \n\nstated on July 1, 2026 in remarks to reporters:\n\n“You know why I’m profiting? Because the stock market’s going up. … I’m profiting because I have a lot of money and a lot of cash.”\n\nBy\nLouis Jacobson\n•\n\nJuly 7, 2026\n\nGraham Platner   \n\nstated on June 17, 2026 in an ad:\n\nSen. Susan Collins “sided with Trump, giving billionaires and corporations a hand out, paid for by cuts to Medicaid and SNAP.”\n\nBy\nAmy Sherman\n•\n\nJune 25, 2026\n\nMarsha Blackburn   \n\nstated on June 19, 2026 in an X post:\n\nThe Obama Presidential Center is “requiring photo ID to enter.”\n\nBy\nAlex Min\n•\n\nJune 23, 2026\n\nKenzie Annis   \n\nstated on June 16, 2026 in an episode of \"Love Island USA\":\n\nA 20/30 vision score means “people have to be at 20 feet to see” things that “I can see at 30 feet.”\n\nBy\nGracey Abernethy\n•\n\nJune 17, 2026\n\nGraham Platner   \n\nstated on June 9, 2026 in a primary night speech:\n\nSen. Susan Collins votes “with Donald Trump 95% of the time.”\n\nBy\nAmy Sherman\n•\n\nJune 10, 2026\n\nDonald Trump   \n\nstated on June 7, 2026 in an interview on NBC's \"Meet the Press\":\n\nThe ongoing ballot counting in California means “they’re cheating on the election.”\n\nBy\nAmy Sherman\n•\n\nJune 8, 2026\n\nJames Talarico   \n\nstated on May 28, 2026 in an X post:\n\n“Adam Hoffman abused a little boy” and Ken Paxton “let Hoffman off the hook.”\n\nBy\nAmy Sherman\n•\n\nJune 3, 2026\n\nTikTok posts   \n\nstated on May 27, 2026 in una publicación en TikTok:\n\nEl presidente Donald Trump firmó una ley para aumentar el salario mínimo a $25 la hora y entra en vigor el 1 de junio.\n\nBy\nMaria Briceño\n•\n\nMay 28, 2026\n\nMarco Rubio   \n\nstated on May 20, 2026 in an X post:\n\n“The reason (people in Cuba) are forced to survive 22 hours a day without electricity is not due to an oil ‘blockade’ by the US.”\n\nBy\nMaria Briceño, \nSamantha Putterman\n•\n\nMay 22, 2026\n\nSocial Media   \n\nstated on May 19, 2026 in in social media posts:\n\n“San Diego mosque shooters identified as trans couple.”\n\nBy\nJeff Cercone\n•\n\nMay 20, 2026\n\nMarcy Kaptur   \n\nstated on May 5, 2026 in an X post:\n\nRepublicans “want you to pay $1 Billion for a ballroom.”\n\nBy\nLouis Jacobson, \nMaria Briceño\n•\n\nMay 8, 2026\n\nLoad More\n\n## Latest Articles\n\n2026 midterm elections fact-checks: Candidates make their final pitches before Election Day \n\nBy\nPolitiFact Staff\n•\n\nNovember 2, 2026\n\n---\n\n2026 midterm elections fact-checks: Attacks in Iowa, stumping in Florida Senate races \n\nBy\nPolitiFact Staff\n•\n\nOctober 23, 2026\n\n---\n\nMichigan US Senate debate: Live fact-checks of Abdul El-Sayed and Mike Rogers’ second showdown \n\nBy\nPolitiFact Staff\n•\n\nOctober 21, 2026\n\n---\n\nFact-check: Healey, Minogue spar on energy, fired state worker in Massachusetts governor’s race debate \n\nBy\nPolitiFact Staff\n•\n\nOctober 15, 2026\n\n---\n\nPublic service announcements or propaganda? Experts weigh in on new Trump ads \n\nBy\nMaria Briceño\n•\n\nSeptember 28, 2026\n\n---\n\n---\n\nLive fact-check: President Donald Trump speaks to UN General Assembly in New York \n\nBy\nPolitiFact Staff\n•\n\nSeptember 22, 2026\n\n---\n\nFrom monument to ‘military complex’: How Trump shifted his pitch for a DC arch \n\nBy\nSamantha Putterman\n•\n\nSeptember 21, 2026\n\n---\n\nFact-checking JD Vance at RNC midterm convention Night 2 \n\nBy\nAmy Sherman, \nLouis Jacobson, \nSamantha Putterman\n•\n\nSeptember 10, 2026\n\n---\n\nFact-check: Trump misleads on midterm candidates Talarico and El-Sayed, affordability at RNC \n\nBy\nPolitiFact Staff\n•\n\nSeptember 10, 2026\n\n---\n\nGround Zero construction crews, firefighter hoist: Fact-checking Trump’s 9/11 response stories \n\nBy\nCaleb McCullough\n•\n\nSeptember 8, 2026\n\n---\n\nCharlie Kirk’s assassination, one year later: How conspiracy theories have evolved \n\nBy\nSamantha Putterman\n•\n\nSeptember 8, 2026\n\n---\n\nWhy Republicans are focusing on transgender issues in competitive 2026 campaigns \n\nBy\nCaleb McCullough\n•\n\nAugust 28, 2026\n\n---\n\n\n\n---\n\nLive: Fact-checking Massachusetts Senate candidates Ed Markey and Seth Moulton’s debate \n\nBy\nPolitiFact Staff\n•\n\nAugust 20, 2026\n\n---\n\nTrump wants to reduce joint military exercises with South Korea. What are they for? \n\nBy\nLoreben Tuquero\n•\n\nAugust 17, 2026\n\n---\n\nThe Epstein midterms: Why the deceased felon appears in Texas, Ohio, Georgia, MA Senate attacks \n\nBy\nAmy Sherman\n•\n\nAugust 13, 2026\n\n---\n\n---\n\n---\n\n---\n\nLoad More\n\n## Latest promises about National\n\nBarack Obama\n\nCreate a National Health Insurance Exchange\n\nMarketplace today is similar to original vision, but not identical\n|\n\nJanuary 3, 2017\n\nBarack Obama\n\nEnergy efficiency rules help reduce, but don’t demand, electricity use\n|\n\nDecember 12, 2016\n\nBarack Obama\n\nBuilding promise gets an energy boost a little too late\n|\n\nNovember 14, 2016\n\nBarack Obama\n\nStimulus included a significant down payment on upgrading the nation’s grid\n|\n\nDecember 13, 2012\n\nBarack Obama\n\nRequire production of more biofuels\n\nNo new 60 billion-gallon requirement\n|\n\nAugust 10, 2012\n\nBarack Obama\n\nNowhere near half\n|\n\nAugust 3, 2012\n\nBarack Obama\n\nModernize air traffic system\n\nProgress made on air traffic system, controllers’ morale\n|\n\nOctober 27, 2011\n\nBarack Obama\n\nObama comes through on both parts of this promise\n|\n\nJanuary 8, 2010\n\nBarack Obama\n\nObama’s request is in the fine print\n|\n\nDecember 18, 2009\n\nBarack Obama\n\nSupport high-speed rail\n\nHigh-speed rail gets stimulus money\n|\n\nMarch 11, 2009\n\nLatest promises about National","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":1110.1259389997722,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}